    m_Untranslated: 'Instruction '
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>1.</b> Go to <a href="https://learn.unity.com/pathway/unity-essentials-in-editor/unit/audio-essentials/tutorial/complete-mission-3-in-the-editor?version=6.3#66c3aa93edbc2a1c2ee4a7dc">Complete
      Mission 3 in the Editor</a> tutorial  on Unity Learn and select <b>Mark All
      Steps Complete</b>. Then return to this tutorial to continue to the next mission.


      <b>2.</b>
      Select <b>Done</b> below, then go back to the Essentials Pathway main menu
      where you can see all of the Missions and proceed to the next one!'
